[InternetShortcut]
URL=https://github.com/sakura-ryoko/servux/issues/new?title=Reference%20Paper%2FFolia%20server-side%20implementation%20of%20servux%3Aentity_data%20(Bukkit%20plugin%2C%20container%20preview%20%2B%20villager%20data%2C%20region-thread%20aware)&body=Since%20Servux%20is%20a%20Fabric%20mod%2C%20servers%20running%20Paper%2FFolia%20cannot%20install%20it.%20We%20implemented%20the%0Aservux%3Aentity_data%20protocol%20as%20a%20standalone%20Bukkit%2FPaper%2FFolia%20plugin%2C%20verified%20byte-compatible%0Awith%20Servux%200.12.2%20(26.3)%2C%20and%20it%20works%20with%20unmodified%20MiniHUD%200.41.2%20on%2026.3.%0A%0AIt%20covers%20both%20branches%20of%20the%20protocol%2C%20so%20Paper%2FFolia%20servers%20get%20the%20same%20two%20features%3A%0A-%20container%20preview%20for%20block%20containers%20(chests%2C%20barrels%2C%20shulkers%2C%20furnaces%2C%20hoppers%2C%20%E2%80%A6)%0A-%20entity%20previews%3A%20villager%20info%20%26%20librarian%20trade%20display%2C%20chest%20boats%2C%20donkeys%2C%20item%20frames%0A%0AWhat%20it%20implements%0A-%20Channel%3A%20servux%3Aentity_data%2C%20packets%20as%20varint%20type%20ids%20(1%20metadata%2C%202%20metadata%20request%2C%0A%20%203%20block%20entity%20request%2C%204%20entity%20request%2C%205%2F6%20simple%20NBT%20responses%2C%207%20unregister)%0A-%20Feature%20coverage%3A%20container%20preview%20via%20the%20block-entity%20branch%20(3%20%E2%86%92%205)%2C%20entity%20previews%0A%20%20(villager%20info%2Ftrades%2C%20chest%20boats%2C%20donkeys%2C%20item%20frames)%20via%20the%20entity%20branch%20(4%20%E2%86%92%206)%0A-%20Handshake%3A%20replies%20to%20the%20metadata%20request%20with%20%7Bversion%3A%202%2C%20servux%3A%20%22servux-fabric-%3Cmcver%3E%22%7D%2C%0A%20%20which%20the%20client%20validates%20before%20it%20accepts%20any%20data%0A-%20Block%20entities%3A%20BlockEntity%23saveWithFullMetadata(registryAccess)%0A-%20Entities%3A%20TagValueOutput.createWithContext(ProblemReporter.DISCARDING%2C%20registryAccess)%20%2B%0A%20%20Entity%23saveWithoutId(...)%20%2B%20the%20%22id%22%20field%2C%20i.e.%20the%20same%20call%20chain%20Servux%20uses%2C%20so%20the%0A%20%20payload%20contents%20are%20identical%20(including%20TAG_BRAIN%20with%20the%20packed%20memories)%0A-%20NBT%20wire%20format%20matches%20DataByteBufUtils%3A%20%5Bint%20length%5D%5Bgzip(%5Bbyte%2010%5D%5BUTF%20%22%22%5D%5Bnbt%20payload%5D)%5D%0A%20%20(equivalent%20to%20NbtIO.writeAnyTag%3B%20note%20FriendlyByteBuf%23writeNbt%20is%20NOT%20compressed%20and%20will%20not%20parse)%0A-%20Player%20entities%3A%20Inventory%20%2F%20EnderItems%20stripped%20unless%20explicitly%20allowed%20(Servux%20default)%0A%0AFolia%20%2F%20region-thread%20safety%20(the%20part%20that%20took%20the%20most%20care)%0A-%20The%20plugin%20message%20callback%20runs%20on%20the%20player's%20region%20thread%3A%20it%20only%20reads%20player%20state%0A-%20Block%20entity%20access%20is%20hopped%20onto%20the%20owning%20region%20via%20Bukkit%23getRegionScheduler().execute(%0A%20%20plugin%2C%20world%2C%20chunkX%2C%20chunkZ%2C%20...)%20before%20touching%20ServerLevel%23getBlockEntity%0A-%20Entity%20lookups%20run%20on%20the%20player's%20region%20(the%20client%20only%20ever%20asks%20for%20entities%20it%20is%0A%20%20looking%20at%2C%20so%20they%20are%20within%20the%20view%20distance)%2C%20with%20a%20configurable%20max%20distance%0A-%20The%20reply%20is%20sent%20back%20through%20the%20player's%20EntityScheduler%2C%20never%20from%20the%20reading%20thread%0A-%20plugin.yml%20declares%20folia-supported%3A%20true%0A%0ACurrent%20limitations%20(happy%20to%20port%20more%20if%20useful)%0A-%20No%20support%20for%20the%20split%20packets%20(10%2F11)%20yet%3A%20a%20container%20whose%20gzipped%20NBT%20exceeds%20the%20plugin%0A%20%20message%20limit%20is%20skipped%20with%20a%20log%20line%0A-%20Only%20the%20entity_data%20channel%3A%20hud_data%20%2F%20structure_bounding_boxes%20%2F%20litematic_data%20%2F%20tweaks_data%0A%20%20are%20not%20implemented%0A-%20Permission%20node%20%2B%20per-player%20rate%20limit%20are%20configurable%20(the%20latter%20matters%20for%20MiniHUD's%0A%20%20librarian%20trade%20scan%2C%20which%20issues%20one%20entity%20request%20per%20villager)%0A%0AAvailability%0A-%20Single%20self-contained%20Java%20source%20file%20against%20the%20Canvas%2FPaper%20API%20%2B%20NMS%20(Mojang%20mappings)%3B%0A%20%20no%20third-party%20dependencies.%20Builds%20with%20JDK%2025%2C%20--release%2021.%0A-%20Can%20be%20published%20as%20a%20separate%20repo%2Fartifact%20under%20LGPLv3%20(matching%20Servux)%20if%20you%20want%20to%20link%0A%20%20it%20from%20the%20README%20as%20a%20third-party%20server-side%20implementation%2C%20or%20reworked%20into%20a%20submodule%0A%20%20if%20you'd%20rather%20host%20it%20here.
